---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Vigilo DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run cancel
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Parse run id
    Vigilo->>DB: Begin cancellation transaction and lock run
    DB-->>Vigilo: Run status

    alt Run does not exist
        Vigilo-->>User: Run not found error
    else Run is completed or failed
        Vigilo-->>User: Cancellation error
    else Run is already cancelled
        Vigilo->>DB: Load cancelled run snapshot
        DB-->>Vigilo: Cancellation outcome
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Run is pending, running, or finalizing
        Vigilo->>DB: Cancel open attempts, executions, and chunks
        Vigilo->>DB: Mark run cancelled and enqueue event
        DB-->>Vigilo: Cancellation outcome
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    end
    deactivate Vigilo
